  {
   "id": "mizuchi-121406@major-2026-02-25",
   "gameId": "mizuchi-121406",
   "displayName": "🚨Multi-language Update: March - Playtesters Wanted Now🚨",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-25T19:34:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "1. Multi-language Update: March",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Console multi-language exclusivity is officially over, and we have fixed up the Steam multi-language build. You're going to be able to enjoy Mizuchi in:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese and Japanese alongside the original English!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "2. Playtesters Wanted",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "While we have tried our best to test the new build, there might be bugs that we didn't catch. Hence, we are now looking for a few playtesters to test the new build in the new languages!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you are interested, please submit the playtester application form here:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "3. Note to existing players",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This update will use brand new saves. If you're halfway through the game, you will not see your old saves when the update is live. But worry not! You will be able to revert to this current version and continue playing. Alternatively, you can finish the current playthrough before March 5th to avoid the trouble.☺️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "4. Wishlist Red Rebellion! 😆",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you haven't yet, please wishlist our next game, Red Rebellion! It will help a ton in urging Steam to show it to more players like you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2114160\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
